		{
			description: [
				"Claim this before the first sunset. Place the Mega Torch at your homestead to suppress natural hostile spawning nearby. It does not disable spawners and it does not make the wider horizon safe."
				"The bed is an emergency reset, not the intended answer to every night. The protected homestead gives you room to work after dark while the frontier remains dangerous."
			]
